WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.300
and welcome back to Sister Location: Custom Night.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.000
Now were gonna do "Weirdos", and this one doesn't actually seem all that hard.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.960
We only have the Minireena and the Electrobab and then Yenndo and Bonnet.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:17.400
It's- it's not even any active threats; it's only Yenndo that's the only one that can actually kill you.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.800
And then Lolbit just- you gotta type LOL, or click on the keypad.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.400
Either one does it. You just doodley-doo and he's gone.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.680
So we're gonna go into this and we're gonna smash through these next few ones,

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.000
because it seems like they're just an interesting combination as opposed

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.280
to anything that might actually be challenging.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.360
The only thing we gotta look out for is Electrobab.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.980
Cause there's nobody at the doors, that's for damn sure.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.640
[Oxygen squeak] Mark: Here we go. [shock]

