[Bonnet giggles]

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.420
Oh ah fuckin'... wow, okay.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:51.160
Yenndo might be a bit of a problem if he's gonna that big of a dick to me.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.660
But other than that, not too terribly bad.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.900
That's gonna be weird if Yenndo doesn't go away on the f-

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.420
on the second flip up.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:02.500
Because if he can appear twice in a row... ehh, that's kinda a bit of a problem.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.500
[More squeaking]

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.440
[More giggles]

