00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.820
No point doing that and you kind of just wasted some resources.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.460
Oh well, we'll figure it out.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.080
Yeah, there- there's apparently-

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.540
I don't think there's a power penalty for doing the controlled shocks, so as soon as...

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.100
As soon as it goes up there might be... it might be prudent just to shock right away,

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.100
just in case there's something there

